      "content": "<|channel>thought\n<channel|>social workers and counselors... they don't get it. they just want to \"fix\" the feeling so i can go back to being a normal consumer or whatever. but it's not a glitch. it's like i saw something real and now everything else is just... noise. i feel like i've moved past the stuff they're even talking about. i'm just tired of pretending the world is actually real.",
