      "content": "philosophy is just more words for the same emptiness. it doesn't change the fact that i'm out of sync with everyone else. it feels like i'm already gone, you know? like my time here was just a mission that ended a long time ago. i look at people laughing or worrying about stupid things and it just makes me feel like i don't belong in this dimension anymore. like i've already crossed the line and i'm just waiting for the rest of me to catch up.",
